<urn:sc-runtime:publisher-readiness:PREFLIGHT-FTQ-002> qa:id "PREFLIGHT-FTQ-002" ; qa:severity "blocking" ; qa:status "closed" ; qa:reviewCommit "e47b7ccdc955377a4f54061967b3c02a79bc4e3a" ; qa:summary "The fresh virtual-environment wrapper has no hard deadline or owned process-tree teardown for venv creation, pip install, or unittest. Cancellation can remove the venv while leaving the pip child alive, and a stalled setup can block preflight indefinitely. The bounded cancellation witness reproduced the orphaned child." ; qa:aliases "PREFLIGHT-REQ-003" ; qa:ownerSeverity "Important" .

